-mex","plural":"épices tex-mex","qty":2,"unit":"c. à c.","have":false},{"name":"huile d'olive","plural":"huile d'olive","qty":1,"unit":"c. à s.","have":false},{"name":"sel","plural":"sels","qty":null,"unit":"","have":false}],"steps":[{"text":"Fais cuire le riz.","timer":{"label":"Cuisson","min":12}},{"text":"Fais revenir le poivron en dés avec les épices 5 min, ajoute les haricots et le maïs 3 min.","timer":{"label":"Poêle","min":8}},{"text":"Garnis les tortillas de riz, de légumes et de cheddar, roule et fais dorer 2 min de chaque côté.","timer":{"label":"Poêle","min":4}}]},{"title":"Risotto aux champignons au four","intro":"Le risotto crémeux, sans rester devant la casserole.","minutes":40,"calories":540,"difficulty":"Facile","imageSearch":"baked mushroom risotto","veg":true,"oven":true,"cold":false,"missing":"","origin":"","serves":4,"items":[{"name":"riz arborio","plural":"riz arborio","qty":300,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"champignon de Paris","plural":"champignons de Paris","qty":300,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"oignon","plural":"oignons","qty":1,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"bouillon de légumes","plural":"bouillons de légumes","qty":2,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"parmesan râpé","plural":"parmesan râpé","qty":60,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"beurre","plural":"beurres","qty":30,"unit":"g","have":false},{"name":"sel","plural":"sels","qty":null,"unit":"","have":false},{"name":"poivre","plural":"poivres","qty":null,"unit":"","have":false}],"steps":[{"text":"Préchauffe le four à 180 °C.","timer":null},{"text":"Dans une cocotte qui va au four, fais revenir l'oignon et les champignons dans le beurre, puis ajoute le riz.","timer":null},{"text":"Verse 90 cl d'eau bouillante avec les bouillons, couvre et enfourne 25 min.","timer":{"label":"Four","min":25}},{"text":"Ajoute le parmesan, mélange vivement et sers.","timer":null}]},{"title":"Burritos au poulet","intro":"Des burritos au poulet et à l'avocat, bien garnis.","minutes":35,"calories":640,"diff